        "original_id": "18d26b16-5ac9-5707-a712-02893eaafc13",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: George Harrison, Ravi Shankar, the Beatles\n- Products: Dark Horse, \"Simply Shady\"\n- Events: North American tour, the Beatles' 1966 US tour\n\nFacts:\n- The Beatles staged their third concert tour of America in August 1966, and it was the last commercial tour they ever undertook.\n- George Harrison released the song \"Simply Shady\" on his 1974 album Dark Horse.\n- In November and December 1974, George Harrison staged a controversial North American tour with co-headliner Ravi Shankar.\n- The album Dark Horse was keenly anticipated on release and became associated with George Harrison's 1974 North American tour.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
